[["wrb.fr",null,"[null,[\"c_045fbde04029bde3\",\"r_eb76eaa6cd7a158a\"],null,null,[[\"rc_a865bb058c2d4f5a\",[\"### SpaceX Valuation Outlook (Year-End 2026)\\n\\nFollowing its landmark mid-2026 public listing—which debuted at $135 per share—and trading around the **$2.0T to $2.2T** market capitalization mark, expert projections for year-end 2026 reflect wide divergence across major institutional desks:\\n\\n| Scenario | Implied Valuation | Average Implied Share Price | Key Proponents / Consensus |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| **Bull Case** | **$3.0T – $4.0T+** | $300 – $400+ | Morgan Stanley (Base $300, Long-term Bull $600+), Raymond James ($800 high target) |\\n| **Consensus / Base Case** | **~$2.2T – $2.5T** | ~$230 – $240 | 33-Analyst Wall Street Consensus ($235.10 average target) |\\n| **Bear Case** | **$1.0T – $1.5T** | $75 – $150 | Morningstar ($154 optimistic cap)\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,[1],\"en\",null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,[[[],\"Searched the web\",\"Google Search\",\"https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/productlogos/googleg/v6/192px.svg\",[],\"Searched the web\",\"\",[[\"https://t0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.thinkmarkets.com/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://www.thinkmarkets.com/en/trading-academy/market-events/spacex-ipo-2026-date-spacex-valuation-and-proxy-share-cfds/\",\"SpaceX Valuation 2026: Latest Figures, IPO Date \\u0026 How to Trade\",null,[]],[\"https://t3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://satnews.com/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://satnews.com/2025/12/06/spacex-targets-800-billion-valuation-in-secondary-sale-eyes-2026-ipo/\",\"SpaceX Targets $800 Billion Valuation in Secondary Sale, Ey