Execution Friction:\",[[0,46,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"At valuations exceeding $2 trillion against mid-twenties billion revenue projections, multiples trade at rich price-to-sales ratios. Any deceleration in Starlink subscriber growth could trigger multiple contraction.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Starship Development Capex \\u0026 Cash Burn:\",[[0,39,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Starship development and orbital test scaling require massive ongoing capital expenditures. Regulatory delays (FAA orbital launch licensing), test anomalies, or payload deployment bottlenecks could push profitability timelines further out.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Geopolitical \\u0026 Spectrum Regulatory Headwinds:\",[[0,45,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Starlink's international footprint is subject to sovereign regulatory approvals, orbital debris mitigation scrutiny, and optical interference complaints from the astronomical and scientific communities.\"]]]]],1]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"Sources \\u0026 References\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Finbold: Wall Street Analysts SpaceX Price Target Consensus\",[[0,59,[null,[\"https://finbold.com/analysts-set-spacex-target-heres-spcx-price-performance/\"]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Quartz: Goldman Sachs and Morgan Stanley Split on SpaceX Valuation\",[[0,66,[null,[\"https://qz.com/goldman-sachs-morgan-stanley-spacex-price-target-070726\"]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"The Motley Fool: Inside Morgan Stanley's SpaceX Forecast and Valuation Scenarios\",[[0,80,[null,[\"https://www.fool.com/investing/2026/08/11/spacex-stock-could-reach-600-according-to-morgan-stanley-heres-how/\"]]]]]]]]]]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"3.8 Flash\",true,[[[[1004,\"Longer\",5,null,[\"expand\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/