+), Raymond James ($800 high target)\"]]]]]],[null,[[[[null,[null,0,\"Consensus / Base Case\",[[0,21,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"~$2.2T – $2.5T\",[[0,14,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"~$230 – $240\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"33-Analyst Wall Street Consensus ($235.10 average target)\"]]]]]],[null,[[[[null,[null,0,\"Bear Case\",[[0,9,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"$1.0T – $1.5T\",[[0,13,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"$75 – $150\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Morningstar ($154 optimistic cap), Phillip Securities ($75 target)\"]]]]]]],true]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"Key Upside Catalysts\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Starlink Cash Generation \\u0026 Direct-to-Cell Expansion:\",[[0,52,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Starlink remains the primary driver of recurring, high-margin cash flow. Upside targets model continued subscriber acceleration, expansion into maritime and aviation mobility, and commercial rollout of Direct-to-Cell spectrum partnerships.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Starship Cadence \\u0026 Reusability Economics:\",[[0,41,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Operational scaling of the fully reusable Starship dramatically lowers launch costs per kilogram. Hitting rapid orbital reflight cadences allows SpaceX to deploy next-generation V3 Starlink satellites and fulfill Artemis moon landing milestones ahead of schedule.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Orbital Compute \\u0026 AI Infrastructure Speculation:\",[[0,48,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"The most aggressive Wall Street bull cases (e.g., Morgan Stanley's extended targets) factor in emerging optionality around orbital edge-compute nodes, secure low-latency space data networks, and defense surveillance systems.\"]]]]],1]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"Key Downside Risks\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"High Valuation Multiples \\u0026 Execution Friction:\",[[0,46,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"At valuations exceeding $2 trillion against mid-twenties billion revenue projections, multiples trade at rich price-to-sales ratios. Any deceleration in Starlink subscriber growth could trigger multiple contraction.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Starship Development Capex \\u0026 Cash Burn:\",[[0,39,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Starship development and orbital test scaling require massive ongoing capital expenditures. Regulatory delays (FAA orbital launch licensing), test anomalies, or payload deployment bottlenecks could push profitability timelines further out.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Geopolitical \\u0026 Spectrum Regulatory Headwinds:\",[[0,45,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Starlink's international footprint is subject to sovereign regulatory approvals, orbital debris mitigation scrutiny, and optical interference complaints from the astronomical and scientific communities.\"]]]]],1]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"Sources \\u0026 References\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Finbold: Wall Street Analysts SpaceX Price Target Consensus\",[[0,59,[null,[\"https://finbold.com/analysts-set-spacex-target-heres-spcx-price-performance/\"]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Quartz: Goldman Sachs and Morgan Stanley Split on SpaceX Valuation\",[[0,66,[null,[\"https://qz.com/goldman-sachs-morgan-stanley-spacex-price-target-070726\"]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"The Motley Fool: Inside Morgan Stanley's SpaceX Forecast and Valuation Scenarios\",[[0,80,[null,[\"https://www.fool.com/investing/2026/08/11/spacex-stock-could-reach-600-according-to-morgan-stanley-heres-how/\"]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Investing.com: Analyst Coverage and Long-Term Revenue Projections\",[[0,65,[null,[\"https://www.investing.com/news/analyst-ratings/spacex-stock-added-to-morgan-stanley-space-60-list-on-growth-outlook-93CH-4788823\"]]]]]]]]]]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"3.8 Flash\",true,[[[[1004,\"Longer\",5,null,[\"expand\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/expand/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1005,\"Shorter\",6,null,[\"compress\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/compress/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1002,\"Don't personalize\",2,null,[\"person_cancel\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/person_cancel/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1001,\"Try again\",1,null,[\"refresh\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/refresh/default/24px.svg\",null,true]]]]],null,2,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,1]"]]
